## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design secure, extensible Android architectures with process isolation, IPC, and governance for third-party extensions.

## Key Concepts
- Dynamic feature modules and per-extension manifests
- android:process and android:isolatedProcess usage
- AIDL surface for defined extension APIs
- Resource budgets, trust boundary, and verifier-based validation
- Accessibility testing and security hardening

